BEHAVIOR connect

DESCRIPTION
  Client-side: establishes TCP connection to a server.
  Call socket first, then connect with server address.
  Address format: sockaddr_in (same as bind).
  Blocks until connected or error. Returns 0 on success.

CONTRACT
  INPUT fd int 8
  INPUT addr bytes 128
  INPUT addr_len int 8
  OUTPUT status int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 697435f5

NATIVE
